;; tokigusuri 時薬 — seed pharmaceutical patent-cliff graph (real, PUBLIC drugs + access channels)
;; ADR-2606171300 · vocabulary: pharma-patent-ontology (00-contracts/schemas/pharma-patent-ontology.kotoba.edn)
;;
;; SCOPE GUARD (constitutional, G1 — read first):
;;   - tokigusuri is an ACCESS / RELEASE map of the patent cliff, NEVER a patent-busting /
;;     infringement-inducement tool, NEVER a freedom-to-operate (FTO) legal opinion, NEVER an
;;     investment / short signal on pharma equities, NEVER a per-company verdict. Aggregate-first.
;;   - The lens is ACCESS-BARRIER concentration (which essential medicines are gated by remaining
;;     exclusivity) vs RELEASE (generic / biosimilar / expiry availability), routed to RELEASE
;;     (解放 — the liberation of the medicine to all). The 取-holder is the EXCLUSIVITY-BARRIER;
;;     the bearer is patients / the public. karma lives ONLY on edges (:en/barrier-load; N1).
;;   - LAWFUL routes only: generic/biosimilar entry is for OFF-PATENT / EXPIRING drugs; for
;;     still-on-patent drugs the disclosed lawful mechanisms are Medicines Patent Pool voluntary
;;     licensing + TRIPS/Doha flexibilities. Circumvention of a live patent is unrepresentable.
;;   - OBSERVATION → HANDOFF only: candidates flow to yakushi 薬師 (manufacture) / ADR-2604271830
;;     (open-seiyaku handoff); tokigusuri never manufactures and never asserts legal FTO.
;;
;; SOURCING: patent status / expiry / exclusivity are DISCLOSED facts — FDA Orange Book +
;;   Purple Book, EPO / national patent registers, WHO Model List of Essential Medicines,
;;   Medicines Patent Pool licence registry — :authoritative where the structural fact is public
;;   (e.g. adalimumab biosimilars exist; imatinib is off-patent; dolutegravir is MPP-licensed).
;;   The SAMPLE is a bounded illustrative seed (:representative coverage), NOT exhaustive, and
;;   barrier-load values are representative severities, NOT measured exclusivity terms. No
;;   fabricated coverage. Live ingest is G7/Council-gated. Status/expiry are DISCLOSED, never
;;   tokigusuri adjudications (N3).

